                                                        <p id="search-09533864-9c0e-4630-859c-bf110d27fd5a">    
                                                                         
                                                                     
                                                                     Each context has its own MCP endpoint. When you distribute via MCP, AI tools receive exactly the data scoped in that context — tokens, documentation, components, files, and skills — nothing more.<br />Users need a Supernova account to connect.</p>
                                                
                                    
                                    
                                                                        
                                                    
